%% Four labelled self-loops on one state take two nested arcs on each free side, every one certified: https://github.com/nullean/mermaider/issues/49
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> WaitingForIP: Actor created

    WaitingForIP --> WaitingForInit: InspectedData(ip)
    WaitingForInit --> Ready: ContainerInitialised

    Ready --> Ready: ClusterEndpoints\n(update endpointRules)
    Ready --> Ready: AclData\n(update customUserRules)
    Ready --> Ready: TreeCacheEvent\n(config store change)
    Ready --> Ready: InspectedData\n(IP change)

    Ready --> Stopped: RemoveRules

    note right of Ready
        On every state update:
        publishes ContainerRules
        to FirewallService
    end note

    note right of Stopped
        Sends DeleteInstance
        to FirewallService
    end note
